# --- Frontend ↔ Supabase connection ---
# 1) Copy this file to `.env` in the frontend folder.
# 2) Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API se values lo.
# 3) Real keys sirf `frontend/.env` me rakho — Git me commit mat karo.
# CLI link: `cd backend` then `supabase link --project-ref <ref>`

VITE_SUPABASE_URL= Paste Your Supabase URL Here
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY= Paste Your Supabase Anon Key Here